Prefix: : <https://finsight-tech.com/ontology/examples/lifecycle-lineage#>

Ontology: <https://finsight-tech.com/ontology/examples/lifecycle-lineage>


# ************************************************************************
# Financial Lifecycle Lineage
# ************************************************************************
#
# Integrates pre-trade artefacts, business events, lifecycle conditions,
# temporal qualification, identity-preserving amendment and successor
# lineage. The example deliberately does not introduce Lifecycle as a class.
#


### Core financial things

Class: FinancialThing

Class: Trade
    SubClassOf: FinancialThing

Class: FinancialContract
    SubClassOf: FinancialThing

Class: Settlement
    SubClassOf: FinancialThing

Class: PaymentObligation
    SubClassOf: FinancialThing

Class: TradeTerms


### Pre-trade business artefacts

Class: BusinessArtefact

Class: RequestForQuote
    SubClassOf: BusinessArtefact

Class: Quote
    SubClassOf: BusinessArtefact

Class: Order
    SubClassOf: BusinessArtefact


### Business events

Class: BusinessEvent

Class: TradeExecution
    SubClassOf: BusinessEvent

Class: AmendmentEvent
    SubClassOf: BusinessEvent

Class: NovationEvent
    SubClassOf: BusinessEvent

Class: Payment
    SubClassOf: BusinessEvent


### Temporal concepts

Class: TimeInstant

Class: TimePeriod

ObjectProperty: occurredAt
    Domain: BusinessEvent
    Range: TimeInstant

ObjectProperty: effectiveFrom
    Domain: TradeTerms
    Range: TimeInstant

ObjectProperty: validDuring
    Range: TimePeriod


### Pre-trade lineage into trade formation

ObjectProperty: respondsTo
    Domain: Quote
    Range: RequestForQuote

ObjectProperty: basedOnQuote
    Domain: Order
    Range: Quote

ObjectProperty: executesOrder
    Domain: TradeExecution
    Range: Order

ObjectProperty: resultsInTrade
    Domain: TradeExecution
    Range: Trade


### Trade and contractual arrangement

ObjectProperty: hasContractualArrangement
    Domain: Trade
    Range: FinancialContract


### Identity-preserving amendment

ObjectProperty: amends
    Domain: AmendmentEvent
    Range: Trade

ObjectProperty: establishesTerms
    Domain: AmendmentEvent
    Range: TradeTerms

ObjectProperty: termsOf
    Domain: TradeTerms
    Range: Trade

Class: TradeAmendment
    SubClassOf:
        AmendmentEvent,
        amends exactly 1 Trade


### Settlement lifecycle condition

Class: LifecycleCondition

Class: SettlementCondition
    SubClassOf: LifecycleCondition

Class: OutstandingSettlementCondition
    SubClassOf: SettlementCondition

Class: SettledSettlementCondition
    SubClassOf: SettlementCondition

Class: SettlementConditionEpisode
    SubClassOf:
        conditionOf exactly 1 Settlement,
        hasCondition exactly 1 SettlementCondition

ObjectProperty: conditionOf
    Domain: SettlementConditionEpisode
    Range: Settlement

ObjectProperty: hasCondition
    Domain: SettlementConditionEpisode
    Range: SettlementCondition

Class: TemporallyQualifiedSettlementConditionEpisode
    SubClassOf:
        SettlementConditionEpisode,
        validDuring exactly 1 TimePeriod


### Payment in the lifecycle

ObjectProperty: appliedTo
    Domain: Payment
    Range: PaymentObligation


### Identity-breaking change and successor lineage

ObjectProperty: endsContract
    Domain: NovationEvent
    Range: FinancialContract

ObjectProperty: establishesContract
    Domain: NovationEvent
    Range: FinancialContract

ObjectProperty: succeededBy
    Domain: FinancialContract
    Range: FinancialContract
    InverseOf: precededBy

ObjectProperty: precededBy
    Domain: FinancialContract
    Range: FinancialContract

Class: ContractNovation
    SubClassOf:
        NovationEvent,
        endsContract exactly 1 FinancialContract,
        establishesContract min 1 FinancialContract

